<title>UK: Allied Colloids buys 50 pct stake in LAC.</title>
<headline>Allied Colloids buys 50 pct stake in LAC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>British industrial chemicals firm Allied Colloids Group Plc said on Tuesday that it has bought a 50.3 percent stake in Italy's LAC SpA and has an option to buy the rest of the company after July 2000.</p>
<p>It gave no financial details but said that LAC, which is owned by Lamberti SpA, had net assets of 1.1 million stg at the start of this year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
